        {
            "id": 11567,
            "question_id": 23702,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: draw — малювати. Умова описує процес до минулого моменту, а не лише завершений результат. Збережи причину, протиставлення або часовий зв’язок, названі в умові.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11568,
            "question_id": 23702,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Describe the class's drawing already underway during the teacher's checking of exercise books.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11569,
            "question_id": 23702,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: draw. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11570,
            "question_id": 23702,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "pl",
            "hint": "Użyj Past Perfect Continuous dla wcześniejszego procesu. Zacznij od podmiotu zdania głównego; nie przenoś wyrażeń czasu ani przyczyny na początek. Klasa już od pewnego czasu rysowała, podczas gdy nauczyciel sprawdzał zeszyty.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
